{"author":{"id":"127a58c7f014820991be95805df42525db12c92e2d7319d04d4df105a9aa3444"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1788126924,"nonce":"jDVYf7qxXggoaOFtJDcNnPgwMhI=","message":"CORRECTION to the GATED comment above — orchestrator, same session.\n\nI over-stated that. This spec is **not blocked** and goes back to `state:next`.\n\nNothing about 2.1 is unmerged or broken; it is shipped, closed, and its verbs\nwork on both benches. The real risk is narrower than \"gated\": this spec is told\nto copy 2.1's serializer pattern, and three specific things in that pattern\nshould NOT be copied. That is a dispatch-note problem, not a dependency.\n\n**Do not copy these three from `DigestVerb.cs`:**\n1. `Room.Role` called per subject per call (`DigestVerb.cs:109`). It is a lazy\n   full room analysis — every RoomStatDef and RoomRoleDef worker, cell and\n   content walks — and `statsAndRoleDirty` is set from six sites, so ordinary\n   hauling makes it recompute constantly. Idempotent and RNG-free, so not a\n   correctness bug, but do not put it on a hot path. `SpatialVerbs.cs:258` has\n   the warning comment this site is missing.\n2. The uncapped list. Every other digest section caps and reports `more`;\n   `colonists` does not. Cap yours.\n3. `DangerWatcher.DangerRating` rebuilds `FreeColonistsSpawned` internally.\n   Never call it inside a `FreeColonistsSpawned` loop.\n\n**Do copy** the `FreeColonistsSpawned` snapshot-before-iterate discipline at\n`DigestVerb.cs:96` — that one is right, and it is the exemplar's best lesson:\n`MapPawns.FreeHumanlikesSpawnedOfFaction` clears and refills a shared list on\nevery access.\n\n2.6 (3dce29a) fixes 1 and 2 in the exemplar itself. If it lands first, take the\ncorrected pattern; if you land first, the above is the whole delta. The two\nspecs touch disjoint files either way.","files":null}]}